.TH AD_DEMO 1 "2026-09-10" "ad 2.0" "ad scripts"
.SH NAME
ad_demo \- demo runner with preset examples
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_demo
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_demo
runs three pre-configured ad_vim animations end-to-end through the
.BR ad_pipeline (1)
driver (compute \(-> postprocess \(-> pace \(-> animator) in
.B \-\-no\-display
mode, so no terminal animator UI is shown \(em the pipeline simply
runs to completion and prints progress.
.PP
The demos exercised are:
.PP
.RS
.nf
1. Small Python    \(em tests/examples/01_small_python   (speed 2)
2. Python Classes  \(em tests/examples/32_python_classes  (speed 2)
3. Large Python    \(em tests/examples/33_large_python    (speed 5)
.fi
.RE
.PP
Use this script to smoke-test the pipeline after a build, or as a
quick "does it work?" check.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h , " \-\-help"
Show detailed help and exit. This script takes no other arguments.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B ad_demo
Run all three demo animations.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR ad_vim (1),
.BR ad_pipeline (1)
